      "description": "LeaseState is the state of a lease evaluated at read time.\n\n - LEASE_STATE_ACTIVE: The lease was renewed within ttl plus the skew allowance.\n - LEASE_STATE_EXPIRED: The lease is past expires_at plus the skew allowance."
